: Audio; 
<span id="S4.T6.2.1.24.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.3pt;"><img src="2509.03883v1/figs/logo/realtime-icon.png" id="S4.T6.g44" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:16/16;" width="16" height="16" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span>
